---
const choices=[{id:'modern',number:'01',name:'깔끔한 여행 매거진',fonts:'Pretendard + Manrope',description:'선명한 한글과 부드러운 영문. 사진과 지구본에 시선이 머무는 조합.',tag:'비교안'},{id:'atlas',number:'02',name:'개성 있는 아틀라스',fonts:'IBM Plex Sans KR + Plex Sans / Mono',description:'조금 더 구조적인 인상. 장소명과 날짜, 좌표에 기록의 성격을 더합니다.',tag:'기록 중심'},{id:'photobook',number:'03',name:'절제된 사진집',fonts:'Noto Serif KR + Pretendard + Manrope',description:'명조는 제목에만. 읽는 부분은 담백하게, 사진집의 여운은 남깁니다.',tag:'현재 적용'}];
---
<!doctype html><html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"/><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"/><title>ELSEWHERE. 서체 비교</title></head><body>
<header class="preview-header"><div><a href="/" class="preview-logo">ELSEWHERE.</a><span class="preview-divider">/</span><h1>서체 미리보기</h1></div><p>같은 사진, 다른 인상. 조합을 눌러 비교해 보세요.</p><a id="open-preview" href="/?type=photobook" target="_blank" rel="noopener">선택한 조합 크게 보기 ↗</a></header>
<main><div class="choices" role="group" aria-label="서체 조합">{choices.map((choice,i)=><button class="choice" data-choice={choice.id} aria-pressed={i===2?'true':'false'}><span class="choice-top"><span>{choice.number} / {choice.tag}</span><span class="choice-check" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span><strong>{choice.name}</strong><span class="font-names">{choice.fonts}</span><span class="choice-description">{choice.description}</span></button>)}</div>
<div class="preview-controls"><div role="group" aria-label="비교할 화면"><button data-screen="home" aria-pressed="true">지구본 홈</button><button data-screen="story" aria-pressed="false">여행기 본문</button></div><div role="group" aria-label="화면 크기"><button data-width="wide" aria-pressed="true">넓은 화면</button><button data-width="mobile" aria-pressed="false">모바일</button></div><p id="preview-status" role="status">서체를 불러오는 중…</p></div>
<div class="frame-area"><iframe id="type-frame" title="선택한 서체 조합의 실제 사이트 화면" src="/?type=photobook"></iframe></div><p class="preview-note">현재 사이트는 ③ 절제된 사진집 조합을 사용합니다. 여기서의 선택은 비교 화면에만 적용됩니다.</p></main>
<script>
type Choice='modern'|'atlas'|'photobook';type Screen='home'|'story';
const allowed:Choice[]=['modern','atlas','photobook'];const params=new URLSearchParams(location.search);let choice:Choice=allowed.includes(params.get('style') as Choice)?params.get('style') as Choice:'photobook';let screen:Screen=params.get('screen')==='story'?'story':'home';let mobile=params.get('width')==='mobile';
const frame=document.querySelector<HTMLIFrameElement>('#type-frame')!;const status=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#preview-status')!;const open=document.querySelector<HTMLAnchorElement>('#open-preview')!;
function update(push=false){const url=`${screen==='home'?'/':'/journal/sample-trip-02/'}?type=${choice}`;frame.src=url;open.href=url;frame.classList.toggle('mobile-width',mobile);document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-choice]').forEach(b=>b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(b.dataset.choice===choice)));document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-screen]').forEach(b=>b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(b.dataset.screen===screen)));document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-width]').forEach(b=>b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String((b.dataset.width==='mobile')===mobile)));status.textContent='서체를 불러오는 중…';if(push){const next=new URL(location.href);next.searchParams.set('style',choice);next.searchParams.set('screen',screen);next.searchParams.set('width',mobile?'mobile':'wide');history.replaceState({},'',next);}}
document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-choice]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{choice=b.dataset.choice as Choice;update(true);}));document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-screen]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{screen=b.dataset.screen as Screen;update(true);}));document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-width]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{mobile=b.dataset.width==='mobile';frame.classList.toggle('mobile-width',mobile);document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-width]').forEach(option=>option.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String((option.dataset.width==='mobile')===mobile)));const next=new URL(location.href);next.searchParams.set('width',mobile?'mobile':'wide');history.replaceState({},'',next);}));
frame.addEventListener('load',async()=>{const doc=frame.contentDocument;if(!doc)return;const current=frame.src;await doc.fonts.ready;if(current!==frame.src||doc!==frame.contentDocument)return;const loaded=[...doc.fonts].some(f=>f.status==='loaded');status.textContent=loaded?'서체 적용 완료':'서체 연결 확인 중 · 잠시 후 다시 선택해 주세요';doc.querySelectorAll<HTMLAnchorElement>('a[href^="/"]:not([data-photo])').forEach(a=>{const next=new URL(a.href);next.searchParams.set('type',choice);a.href=next.href;});});update();
</script>
<style is:global>
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#eeece6;color:#24231f;font-family:Arial,'Malgun Gothic',sans-serif}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}button{font:inherit;color:inherit;cursor:pointer}a:focus-visible,button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #4f594c;outline-offset:4px}.preview-header{padding:25px 36px 22px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;border-bottom:1px solid #d4d2ca}.preview-header>div{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}.preview-logo{font-size:18px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.07em}.preview-divider{color:#aaa89d}h1{font-size:15px;margin:0;font-weight:500}.preview-header p{font-size:12px;color:#67675f;margin:0}.preview-header>a{font-size:11px;border-bottom:1px solid #a6a599;padding:8px 0}.choices{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin:20px 36px}.choice{background:#f6f3ed;border:1px solid #d9d6ce;padding:18px 20px;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;min-height:150px}.choice[aria-pressed=true]{border:2px solid #4f594c;padding:17px 19px;background:#faf8f3}.choice-top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.06em;color:#67675f}.choice-check{font-size:15px}.choice[aria-pressed=true] .choice-check{color:#4f594c}.choice strong{font-size:17px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:600}.font-names{font-size:11px;color:#67675f}.choice-description{font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;color:#67675f}.preview-controls{display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:center;padding:0 36px 17px;flex-wrap:wrap}.preview-controls>div{display:flex;border:1px solid #cfcdc4;padding:3px;gap:3px}.preview-controls button{border:0;background:transparent;font-size:12px;padding:9px 13px;min-height:36px}.preview-controls button[aria-pressed=true]{background:#4f594c;color:#fff}.preview-controls p{margin:0 0 0 auto;font-size:11px;color:#67675f}.frame-area{padding:0 20px;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:flex-start}iframe{display:block;border:1px solid #d4d2ca;background:#f6f3ed;width:100%;height:calc(100dvh - 315px);min-height:520px;box-shadow:0 7px 25px #24231f0a}.mobile-width{width:390px;max-width:100%;height:844px}.preview-note{font-size:11px;text-align:center;color:#67675f;padding:12px 20px 25px;margin:0}@media(max-width:850px){.preview-header{padding:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px}.preview-header p{display:none}.choices{margin:15px 20px;gap:8px}.choice{padding:12px;min-height:128px}.choice[aria-pressed=true]{padding:11px}.choice strong{font-size:14px}.choice-description{display:none}.font-names{font-size:10px;line-height:1.6}.preview-controls{padding:0 20px 15px;gap:10px}.preview-controls p{width:100%;margin:0}.frame-area{padding:0 10px}.preview-header>a{font-size:10px}iframe{height:700px;min-height:0}}@media(max-width:450px){.preview-logo{font-size:14px}.preview-header h1{font-size:13px}.preview-header>div{gap:9px}.preview-header>a{width:100%;text-align:right;border:0}.choices{margin-inline:12px}.choice{padding:10px 8px;gap:8px}.choice[aria-pressed=true]{padding:9px 7px}.choice strong{font-size:12px}.choice-top{font-size:9px}.preview-controls{padding-inline:12px}.preview-controls button{font-size:11px;padding:8px 10px}}
</style></body></html>



